# Charmed Clothier {4}{W}, a 3/3 Faerie Advisor with flying: "When this creature enters, create a Royal Role token attached to
# another target creature you control." On turn three Bot1 has Memnite and Ornithopter, and Bot2 an Ornithopter. The trigger refuses
# the Clothier itself (CR 115.1, "another") and Bot2's creature ("you control"); targeting Memnite, the Role makes it 2/2
# (CR 111.10m, 303.4). Ornithopter and the Clothier (flying 3/3) are unchanged.

